  "details": "I have been getting random invites to groups from ppl I have never met and groups I have never been in. It is getting insanely annoying and I think smt needs to be done abt it. Let us be able to somehow block ANY group invites fully or let it become a reportable offense to make alt accounts to invite ppl who have never been in a specific groups instances unless u are friends with the person inviting u or smt. It is so annyoing at this point. Feels like the equivalent of dc bot frq or dms",
